Notes for the integrator:
- Hunk 1 changes an exit code (0 -> 2) for a shape no committed wave uses today: measured over every
  `.ufo/waves/round-*/*-dispatch.json` in the fleet, 334 v1 envelopes, none with zero seats. It does not
  touch the selftest corpus, but `WAVE_CENSUS_SELFTEST` should be re-run (32/32 at b38a206) and one case
  added (`WC33` empty envelope -> exit 2).
- Hunk 2 keeps exit 1 and the existing COUNT_MISMATCH id; the detail string only grows when total lies,
  so WC05/WC26 regexes (`counts\.spawn=… tasks=… counts\.resume=… resumeSends=…$`-anchored) still match
  for the non-lying case.
- Deliberately NOT proposed: results/ready/log/transcript reading. That is `inline-dispatch-evidence.mjs`'s
  contract (I63) and adding it to `kumitate-wave-census-v1` would duplicate the gate, not repair a bug.
